 US 22 West:
 Exit at Park Ave, Scotch Plains. The exit is after a McDonalds restaurant
 on the right, diagonally opposite the Scotchwood Diner on the left and
 immediately before the overpass.  After exiting US 22 west, turn left
 at the light, and use the overpass to cross US 22.  Bear right at the
 bottom of ramp and continue south on Park Ave.
 Turn left at the second traffic light (a staggered intersection).
