adaptable domain-independent data structures and algorithms.

The TowerEiffel Motif Componenets is a flexable and simple mechanism for 
handling callbacks allowing programmers to quickly create and control their 
Motif user interfaces.

Eiffel is a non-proprietary object oriented programming language best known 
for it's built in support for software engineering.  It is an ideal language 
for developing, deploying, and maintaining large complex systems which require 
constant refinement.  Additionally, Eiffel is recognized as one of the best 
languages for learning OO because of it's clean syntax and support for the 
OO paradigm.

